/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (     The primary objective of this project is to design and implement an interactive two-player Ping Pong game using Python. Each player controls a paddle to rally the ball across the screen, aiming to prevent it from passing their side. The game simulates real-time motion, collision detection, and score tracking to create a smooth and engaging gameplay experience.)
/E (     The primary objective of this project is to design and implement an interactive two-player Ping Pong game using Python. Each player controls a paddle to rally the ball across the screen, aiming to prevent it from passing their side. The game simulates real-time motion, collision detection, and score tracking to create a smooth and engaging gameplay experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
