<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (turtle.Screen => to create the screen for the library  window.title\("ping pong"\) => to make the screen title  window.setup\(width=1000 , height=600\)  => to make resolution of the screen into 600*800 window.tracer\(0\)  => to turn off the delay of the screen window.bgcolor\(0,0,.11\)  => back ground color with RGB format window.listen\(\)  => to interact with keyboard window.onkeypress => with every keypress that assigned above turn on the movement function that we made)
/E (turtle.Screen => to create the screen for the library  window.title\("ping pong"\) => to make the screen title  window.setup\(width=1000 , height=600\)  => to make resolution of the screen into 600*800 window.tracer\(0\)  => to turn off the delay of the screen window.bgcolor\(0,0,.11\)  => back ground color with RGB format window.listen\(\)  => to interact with keyboard window.onkeypress => with every keypress that assigned above turn on the movement function that we made)
/Pg 15 0 R
