/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (while True => Main game loop that keeps the game running continuously. window.update\(\) => Refreshes the game screen to show the latest positions. ball.setx\(...\) / ball.sety\(...\) => Moves the ball based on its direction and speed. ball.xcor\(\) / ball.xcor\(\) => gets the current x and y position of the ball if ball.ycor\(\) > 290 => Checks if the ball hits the top edge and makes it bounce back. if ball.ycor\(\) < -290 => Checks if the ball hits the bottom edge and makes it bounce back. if ball.xcor\(\) > 490 => If the ball goes out from the right, Player 1 scores. if ball.xcor\(\) < -490 => If the ball goes out from the left, Player 2 scores. ball.goto\(0, 0\) => Resets the ball to the center after a score.)
/E (while True => Main game loop that keeps the game running continuously. window.update\(\) => Refreshes the game screen to show the latest positions. ball.setx\(...\) / ball.sety\(...\) => Moves the ball based on its direction and speed. ball.xcor\(\) / ball.xcor\(\) => gets the current x and y position of the ball if ball.ycor\(\) > 290 => Checks if the ball hits the top edge and makes it bounce back. if ball.ycor\(\) < -290 => Checks if the ball hits the bottom edge and makes it bounce back. if ball.xcor\(\) > 490 => If the ball goes out from the right, Player 1 scores. if ball.xcor\(\) < -490 => If the ball goes out from the left, Player 2 scores. ball.goto\(0, 0\) => Resets the ball to the center after a score.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
